
--> API Grouping
    What Is API Grouping?
    API grouping is the concept of organizing endpoints into logical sections.
    Instead of dumping all APIs into one long list, grouping creates:
    Clear separation
    Better navigation
    Easier maintenance


    Why API Grouping Is Needed
    Large applications can have hundreds of endpoints
    Makes Swagger UI clean and readable
    Helps teams focus on relevant APIs
    Essential for scalable systems
    From an architectural viewpoint:
    API grouping improves maintainability and usability
